    "turn_idx": 74,
    "turn_text": "I encountered working for several members of Congress, encountering and working with lots more. And I don't just mean Democrats. I truly don't. Now, there's certainly affection nowadays of the other party that I don't think quite as highly. But I do mean it that it was very much across the aisle, Republicans and Democrats. And for the most part, I found them to be dedicated, hardworking, and really, really care about this country and that meant a lot to me.",
